   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Ministerstvo zahrani&#x10d;n&#xfd;ch vec&#xed; a eur&#xf3;pskych z&#xe1;le&#x17e;itost&#xed; SR</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ministry of Foreign and European Affairs of the Slovak Republic</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">MIsia OBSE Kirgizsko 2014</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OSCE Mission Kirgizstan 2014</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; align=&quot;justify&quot;&gt;Rozhodnut&#xed;m St&#xe1;lej rady OBSE &#x10d;. 947 z&#xa0;22. j&#xfa;la 2010 bolo schv&#xe1;len&#xe9; vyslanie 52-&#x10d;lennej misie policajn&#xfd;ch poradcov do Kirgizskej republiky. T&#xfd;mto krokom reagovalo OBSE na potrebu okam&#x17e;itej pomoci pri obnove poriadku, skvalitnen&#xed; pr&#xe1;ce miestnej pol&#xed;cie a&#xa0;pri budovan&#xed; d&#xf4;very v&#xa0;pol&#xed;ciu najm&#xe4; v&#xa0;oblastiach s&#xa0;uzbeckou men&#x161;inou.&#xa0;&#xda;&#x10d;as&#x165; expertov z&#xa0;radov slovenskej pol&#xed;cie je pre SR pova&#x17e;ovan&#xe1; za d&#xf4;le&#x17e;it&#xfa; najm&#xe4; z&#xa0;h&#x13e;adiska posilnenia postavenia SR v&#xa0;regi&#xf3;ne strednej &#xc1;zie a&#xa0;z&#xe1;rove&#x148; z&#xa0;d&#xf4;vodu anga&#x17e;ovania sa v&#xa0;krajin&#xe1;ch v&#xfd;chodnej dimenzie Eur&#xf3;pskej susedskej politiky.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The goal of a police advisory group of the Organization for Security and Cooperation in Europe (OSCE) in Kyrgyzstan is to restore trust in police.&#xa0;&lt;br /&gt;The group monitors the situation and the work of law enforcement agencies in the country&apos;s South, curtails law enforcement agencies and the population from illegal acts, and stimulates local governing organs and the state structure to carefully investigate statements and wishes by the civilian populati&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
